===============
Types of Array 
===============
1. Single Dimensional Array
2. Multi Dimensional Array (Array of Arrays)
Eg - 2D, 3D, 4D, 5D, .........
=======================
Multi Dimensional Array
=======================
Any array stored inside other array is known as Multi Dimensional Array.

===================
2 Dimensional Array
===================
Any single dimensional array stored inside another array is known as 2D array.

=======================
How to create 2D array?
=======================
1. using array literal

datatype[][] variable = {{v1,v2,v3,...}, {v1,v2,v3,...}, ...};


2. using new keyword

datatype[][] variable = new datatype[outer_size][inner_array];

===============
Jagged Array
===============
A jagged array is an array of arrays such that member arrays can be of different sizes, i.e., we can create a 2-D array but with a variable number of columns in each row.

Syntax - 
datatype[][] variable = new datatype[outer_size][]; 